{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0011_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "50af0754192d196ecfa83976ea27976825d38462b69937712c1abcdff73d9f21", "ja": "むむむむ……。\n……もっと。もっとだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "嗯嗯嗯嗯……\n……再一点，再一点喔，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0011_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2143719cc7bbc0de0c8a897f9d34efcd58d4aac9488e9e25b7c1501ebba609a2", "ja": "何をしているんだ、瑞希……。", "zh": "你在做什么啊，瑞希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0011_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "99a120fe5ba61c07a42041e5d19aaaa533aa26b5da8fa645e6a558066055aa1d", "ja": "はい、{$P$}。\n次の仕事に向けて、気合いを入れていました。", "zh": "是，{$P$}。\n为了迎接下一次工作，我正在激励自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0011_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "89f8558d5190b42504dd0be3343647ba1ea07946cbb90366a573e204b0779404", "ja": "自分で言うのもなんですが、最近、成長したかと。\nどうでしょうか。アイドルのオーラ、出ていますか？", "zh": "虽然由自己来说不太好意思，但我觉得自己最近好像\n成长了一些。你觉得呢？我有散发出偶像的光环吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0011_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a1c14390c00a2c003869f6dfc5de44f0f8ec0f9a9ddde2c16b47acdec8120ebe", "ja": "そうだな。俺はずっと瑞希をそばで見ているけど、\nずいぶん成長したと思うよ。", "zh": "有啊。我一直在身旁看着瑞希的表现，\n也觉得你成长了不少喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0011_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "4365352cb6010ece584cd3f7ef668cf8ff54bc845dc6085243ea145b3014a3ea", "ja": "……なんと。冗談のつもりだったのですが……\nこれが、{$P$}の力。", "zh": "……真没想到。我原本只是想开个玩笑……\n这就是，{$P$}的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0011_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "f8d0fa5bfbdad253108ebd67fd8db4681d32e750cb3f866c37c977da19e2c5fd", "ja": "{$P$}。\n私はアイドルとして、まだまだ未熟です。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n作为一名偶像，我还不够成熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0011_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "75a97b7d3839270bcd051039406052e32f0cf90da96459284e7931bb235d9302", "ja": "なのでこれからも、よろしゅく……\nよろしくお願いします。……テイクツー。", "zh": "今后也请你多多指纠……多多指教。\n……我重讲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
